&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid black; padding: 12px; text-align: center; width: 700px&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Scariest Thing I&#039;ve Posted (But It&#039;s Only Scary to Me)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
