&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item Description:&lt;/strong&gt; A printed picture of a house mouse that causes anyone that views it for more than ten seconds to enter a state of panic and climb on the nearest piece of furniture. Viewer will recognize that it is just an image after about two minutes of watching the object. A speech bubble is drawn from the mouth of the mouse with text reading &amp;quot;AM I COOL YET?&amp;quot; written in felt-tip marker. Object was located hidden under a table, which caused a woman to scream and climb on the table.&lt;br /&gt;
