&lt;strong&gt;Current Status:&lt;/strong&gt; In a file cabinet Site-73.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item Description:&lt;/strong&gt; A check book containing &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;200&lt;/span&gt; 187 checks that, each time it is viewed by someone, it displays a picture of a random domestic cat. The pose, breed, and pattern are rarely similar, and two people will not see the same cat. If ripped from the book, the last image seen is the one that will appear on the check and the item will be rendered nonanomalous.&lt;br /&gt;
