&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item Description:&lt;/strong&gt; The body of a middle-aged Caucasian man with heavy augmentation of his body, including compound eyes similar to house flies, wings similar to fly wings, and patches of skin similar to the exoskeleton of a horse fly. Symbols tied to the Sarkicism are found carved into the skin on the subject&#039;s chest, forehead, and back.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Date of Recovery:&lt;/strong&gt; 07-23-2020&lt;br /&gt;
