&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;About me&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/solid&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/solid/medium.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;solid&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forbiddenquest&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394686&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607890588&quot; alt=&quot;forbiddenquest&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394686)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forbiddenquest&quot;  &gt;forbiddenquest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#039;s drawing of me inspired by my nonstop talking about MGS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
I have been lurking for years, during my time at law school especially but in October of 2019 I decided to try my hand at writing an article. I was drawn to this site after reading &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2480&quot;&gt;SCP-2480&lt;/a&gt; and realizing what a wonderful creative outlet this would be.&lt;sup&gt;Especially because a lawyer doesn&#039;t often have time for creative writing in their career.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
So far I&#039;m focused on historical and supernatural fiction &lt;em&gt;(probably more ominous than actual horror, if I&#039;m honest)&lt;/em&gt; and I have a bit of an overarching narrative reaching out through the skips I&#039;ve written. Hopefully that continues. Let&#039;s see together, shall we?&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Series&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-653304-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; - &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/hecatoncheires-cycle-hub&quot;&gt;Hecatoncheires&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This series follows Dr. Iona Varga, MD/PhD, a geneticist and xenobiologist, and Agent Rebekah Douglas, a researcher and psychic with psychometry (being able to &amp;quot;read&amp;quot; an object or person for its history). Dr. Varga is foremost a cynic, you&#039;ll notice during these articles that she does not truly believe gods exist. Magic and gods are simply things we haven&#039;t understood yet. It starts with finding a unique body in Yorkshire:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;►&amp;nbsp;Articles&amp;nbsp;within&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;series&amp;nbsp;◄&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;▼&amp;nbsp;Close&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Chapter One&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4612&quot;&gt;SCP-4612&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: - &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not all Gods Decompose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-653304-2&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;I grow concerned with the others of our Society. Our Brethren must understand the grand scale of our Endeavor. Any cost that comes forthwith will be well earned, whether in pecuniary losses or in our very Blood.&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4712&quot;&gt;SCP-4712&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: - &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Failed Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-653304-3&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;There’s no more space here, crowded, suffocating. Needs more. Needs it.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;…there’s a hole in us&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;….it …it wants to fill t-the gap, and eat&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5612&quot;&gt;SCP-5612&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: - &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Harmatia&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;What could the Creator have been thinking when He shaped that strange flesh? Where must it have come from?&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5512&quot;&gt;SCP-5512&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: - &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Social Contract&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;People with guns are so quick to threaten violence, as if you invented it.&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/catching-up&quot;&gt;Tale I&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Catching Up&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;“I’m not a researcher, Iona. I’m an Israeli girl who found out she was psychic. I’m glad I’ve found a career here, but it’s been a really shit year.”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/looking-forward&quot;&gt;Tale II&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Looking Forward&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;What we have is a hostile force from outside our solar system with a significantly protracted history of interfering with human development.&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/cleaning-house&quot;&gt;Tale III&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cleaning House&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;If you insist, I will kill you all. Is that what you want?&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;- End Chapter I -&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Chapter Two&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-3743&quot;&gt;SCP-3743&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Euboea, Son of Briareos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Their Many Hands guide us in this life. We honor their creation with our blood and bodies. We are their many hands, shaping society in their image.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/repatriation&quot;&gt;Tale IV&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Repatriation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;There’s something over there, and it &lt;strong&gt;touched&lt;/strong&gt; me. I need to talk to the one source of info available to me.&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5957&quot;&gt;SCP-5957&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Baleful Light&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;You killed these children, as surely as if you pointed a gun at their heads. The youth is the lifeblood of the revolution, didn’t you know that?&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/fox-hunt&quot;&gt;Tale V&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; - &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fox Hunt&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot;I’ve executed men before, Egytian. You don’t have the look.&amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
