&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-653304-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. They connect and should be read in order, if you want the maximum experience&amp;#8230; although you could read them separately as well.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-653304-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. This was my first attempt at writing an article, its still my most successful to date.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-653304-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Technically not really part of the series, but following the antics of Dr. Varga and Agent Douglas after SCP-4612, and the events here become important later.&lt;/div&gt;
