					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="display: none"></div> <div class="creditRate"> <div class="rateBox"> <div class="rate-box-with-credit-button"> <div class="creditButton"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-jp-sandbox3.wdfiles.com/local--code/credit%3Abackmodule/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>Info</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/3" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/grigori-karpin-s-author-page">More by this author</a></strong></p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> <div class="creditBottomRate" style="position:relative;height:30px;"> <div style="text-align: center; top: 0px;"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/bones" width="500px" alt="bones" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <h2><span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">About me</span></strong>:</span></h2> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/solid"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/solid/medium.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="solid" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forbiddenquest" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394686&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607890588" alt="forbiddenquest" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394686)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forbiddenquest" >forbiddenquest</a></span>'s drawing of me inspired by my nonstop talking about MGS.</p> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> I have been lurking for years, during my time at law school especially but in October of 2019 I decided to try my hand at writing an article. I was drawn to this site after reading <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2480">SCP-2480</a> and realizing what a wonderful creative outlet this would be.<sup>Especially because a lawyer doesn't often have time for creative writing in their career.</sup><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> So far I'm focused on historical and supernatural fiction <em>(probably more ominous than actual horror, if I'm honest)</em> and I have a bit of an overarching narrative reaching out through the skips I've written. Hopefully that continues. Let's see together, shall we?<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <h2><span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">&quot;Series&quot;</span></strong>:<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-84104-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup> - <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/hecatoncheires-cycle-hub">Hecatoncheires</a></span></span></h2> <p><em>This series follows Dr. Iona Varga, MD/PhD, a geneticist and xenobiologist, and Agent Rebekah Douglas, a researcher and psychic with psychometry (being able to &quot;read&quot; an object or person for its history). Dr. Varga is foremost a cynic, you'll notice during these articles that she does not truly believe gods exist. Magic and gods are simply things we haven't understood yet. It starts with finding a unique body in Yorkshire:</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Articles&nbsp;within&nbsp;the&nbsp;series&nbsp;◄</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;Close</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <h4><span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Chapter One</span></strong></span></h4> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4612">SCP-4612</a></strong>: - <em><strong>Not all Gods Decompose</strong></em><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-84104-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup></li> </ul> <p><em>&quot;I grow concerned with the others of our Society. Our Brethren must understand the grand scale of our Endeavor. Any cost that comes forthwith will be well earned, whether in pecuniary losses or in our very Blood.&quot;</em></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4712">SCP-4712</a></strong>: - <em><strong>A Failed Purpose</strong></em><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-84104-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >3</a></sup></li> </ul> <p><em>There’s no more space here, crowded, suffocating. Needs more. Needs it.</em><br /> <em>…there’s a hole in us</em><br /> <em>….it …it wants to fill t-the gap, and eat</em></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5612">SCP-5612</a></strong>: - <em><strong>Harmatia</strong></em></li> </ul> <p><em>&quot;What could the Creator have been thinking when He shaped that strange flesh? Where must it have come from?&quot;</em></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5512">SCP-5512</a></strong>: - <em><strong>A Social Contract</strong></em></li> </ul> <p><em>&quot;People with guns are so quick to threaten violence, as if you invented it.&quot;</em></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/catching-up">Tale I</a></strong> - <em><strong>Catching Up</strong></em></li> </ul> <p><em>“I’m not a researcher, Iona. I’m an Israeli girl who found out she was psychic. I’m glad I’ve found a career here, but it’s been a really shit year.”</em></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/looking-forward">Tale II</a></strong> - <em><strong>Looking Forward</strong></em></li> </ul> <p><em>&quot;What we have is a hostile force from outside our solar system with a significantly protracted history of interfering with human development.&quot;</em></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/cleaning-house">Tale III</a></strong> - <em><strong>Cleaning House</strong></em></li> </ul> <p><em>&quot;If you insist, I will kill you all. Is that what you want?&quot;</em><br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong>- End Chapter I -</strong></p> </div> <hr /> <h4><span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Chapter Two</span></strong></span></h4> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-3743">SCP-3743</a></strong> - <em><strong>Euboea, Son of Briareos</strong></em></li> </ul> <p><em>Their Many Hands guide us in this life. We honor their creation with our blood and bodies. We are their many hands, shaping society in their image.</em></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/repatriation">Tale IV</a></strong> - <em><strong>Repatriation</strong></em></li> </ul> <p><em>&quot;There’s something over there, and it <strong>touched</strong> me. I need to talk to the one source of info available to me.&quot;</em></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5957">SCP-5957</a></strong> - <em><strong>A Baleful Light</strong></em></li> </ul> <p><em>&quot;You killed these children, as surely as if you pointed a gun at their heads. The youth is the lifeblood of the revolution, didn’t you know that?&quot;</em></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/fox-hunt">Tale V</a></strong> - <em><strong>Fox Hunt</strong></em></li> </ul> <p><em>&quot;I’ve executed men before, Egytian. You don’t have the look.&quot;</em></p> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Timeline&nbsp;of&nbsp;Events&nbsp;-&nbsp;Spoilers◄</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;Security&nbsp;Verified&nbsp;▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><em>Read the above Articles before checking this out!</em></p> </div> <div class="note"> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/ProjectHeca" height="100px" width="100px" alt="ProjectHeca" class="image" /></div> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-size:150%;"><tt>From the Desk of Iona Varga, PhD/MD</tt></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">TIMELINE</span></strong>:</p> <ul> <li><em><strong>2+ billion years ago</strong></em> &#8212; 5612-A arrives on Earth.</li> <li><em><strong>circa 2000&#160;B.C.E.</strong></em> &#8212; 4612-A interferes with the Sumer civilization in Ancient Mesopotamia.</li> <li><em><strong>circa 1000&#160;B.C.E.</strong></em> &#8212; SCP-4612-A takes unknown part in the conflict between Mekhanite and Sakic forces in the Bronze Age Mediterranean region.</li> <li><em><strong>circa 200&#160;B.C.E.</strong></em> &#8212; SCP-4612-A has some unknown interaction with the Daevite civilization’s downfall.</li> <li><em><strong>412&#160;C.E.</strong></em> &#8212; SCP-4612-A appears before a monk at Lindisfarne; the event is significant as the timing is suspiciously close to the initial beginnings of period colloquially called the Dark Ages.</li> <li><em><strong>1347-1352&#160;C.E.</strong></em> &#8212; SCP-4612-A initiates outbreaks of black plague in Sicily, Italy.</li> <li><em><strong>May 5, 1779</strong></em> &#8212; William Henry Eckhart confirms to a fellow member of the Society of Yorkshire Thaumaturgy that he has found the Rite of Solomon (as seen in <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3457">SCP-3457</a>) and intends to use it to bind a god. Eckhart and the rest of the Society intend to destroy whatever force is interfering in humanity’s technological progress.</li> <li><em><strong>September 16, 1779</strong></em> &#8212; The Society of Yorkshire Thaumaturgy succeed in performing the Rite of Solomon, killing SCP-4612-A.</li> <li><em><strong>September 17, 1779</strong></em> &#8212; According to historical records, Eckhart House in Yorkshire, England, is struck by a meteor. In reality, 4612-B arrives and kills all but one member of the Society in revenge for the death of SCP-4612-A. Geoffrey Watts flees England the next day.</li> <li><strong><em>circa 1791</em></strong> &#8212; Watts settles in Clifton Bay, Nassau, Bahamas.</li> <li><em><strong>September 26, 1815</strong></em> &#8212; The community of Clifton is destroyed. Watts dies on his ship as it sinks in the bay.</li> </ul> <ul> <li><em><strong>December 19, 1986</strong></em> &#8212; The corpse of SCP-4612-A is discovered by Foundation personnel, specifically Dr. Varga and Agent Douglas. Site-91 is provisionally approved, taking over the manor grounds of Eckhart House.</li> <li><em><strong>January 21, 1987</strong></em> &#8212; SCP-5612-A is discovered, leading to the discovery of 5612-B.</li> <li><em><strong>June 9, 1987</strong></em> &#8212; Agent Douglas attempts to “read” the cadaver of 4612-A with psychometry and experiences the events of September 17, 1779.</li> <li><em><strong>February 2, 1992</strong></em> &#8212; Agent Douglas awakens from a coma induced to deal with psychological and occult trauma as occurred in researching SCP-4712.</li> <li><em><strong>April 3, 1992</strong></em> &#8212; The UIU begins investigation in the Second Haptic Assembly, which leads to the discover of SCP-5512.</li> <li><em><strong>April 17, 1992</strong></em> &#8212; Dr. Varga re-requests the permission to test the genetic makeup of SCP-4612-A.</li> <li><em><strong>May 3, 1992</strong></em> &#8212; Members of the Second Haptic Assembly assault 5612-B containment staff in Iraq. Agent Douglas and Captain Zadeh's MTF-Beta-777 squad were able to fight off the cultists, but 3/4 of the containment staff on site were KIA. Marquez is confirmed to be 4612-B by Agent Douglas, after confronting him in the conflict.</li> <li><em><strong>May 5, 1992</strong></em> &#8212; Overwatch Council approve Director Varga's Project Hecatoncheires.</li> <li><em><strong>August 15, 1992</strong></em> &#8212; Custom made Ways are found within small distances from Site-91. Joint MTF exploration leads to a pocket dimension being used to house the remnants of Marquez' Second Haptic Assembly in ruins that date from 425 BCE.</li> <li><em><strong>February 22, 1993</strong></em> &#8212; Agent Rebekah Douglas travels back to the extradimensional space designated 4712-B to have a gather information from Marius Albescu (SCP-4712-A) and has a run in with those anomalous creatures that populate the space. She also learns something about the entity infesting the other world, leading to new questions.</li> <li><em><strong>May 02, 1993</strong></em> &#8212; A GRU-P file is discovered during a raid on a MC&amp;D warehouse detailing an investigation and coverup of the events that led to 9 Russian hikers dying in 1959. Discoveries made include a tower from antiquity housing an automated organic surgical center and storage of hundreds of modified humans cadavers.</li> <li><em><strong>June 11, 1993</strong></em> &#8212; A three person team made up of two members of MTF-Omega-20 (&quot;Thought Police&quot;) and a thaumaturge from MTF-Beta-777 (&quot;Hecate's Spear&quot;) travel to Moscow, Russia to hunt down a POI responsible for an attack on the containment site of SCP-5957-A.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5079">SCP-5079</a></strong>: - <em><strong>Isolation Reverie</strong></em></li> </ul> <p><em>Another Sarkic related article, discussing the horrors of loneliness in a digital world. Body Horror included.</em><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5923">SCP-5923</a></strong>: - <em><strong>The Place I Belong</strong></em><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-84104-4" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >4</a></sup></li> </ul> <p><em>A stowaway! Are you enjoying yourself?</em><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>My work for the CanCon2020 Contest</strong></span>:</p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/resurrection-new-faces-hub">Resurrection: New Faces Hub</a></strong> - <em>I made the image!</em></li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/welcome-to-yellowstone">Welcome to Yellowstone</a></strong> - <em>A tale set in Resurrection canon, part of my team's New Faces series.</em></li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/jolly-cooperation">Jolly Cooperation</a></strong> - <em>Let's get to know these characters and get some intrigue going!</em></li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/light-and-the-mole">Light and the Mole</a></strong> - <em>Light always gets her man!</em></li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/bottom-floor">Bottom Floor</a></strong> - <em>In which we see part of Light's new Alpha-9 squad get into some serious trouble, one Irving Gat shows up to lend a hand, and reality takes a serious nose dive.</em></li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/shut-it-down">Shut It Down</a></strong> - <em>In which we see the Final climax of a series and reality full on falling apart, or does it?</em></li> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/tangled-web">Tangled Web</a></strong> - <em>Disaster averted?!?</em></li> </ul> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;Fan&nbsp;Art◄</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▼&nbsp;FUN,&nbsp;huh???&nbsp;▼</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:100%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/4612-B"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/4612-B/medium.jpg" style="width:70%;" alt="4612-B" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:70%;"> <p>Twitter user @Yorickjoker’s art based on <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4612">SCP-4612</a>.</p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:100%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/4612"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/4612/medium.jpg" style="width:70%;" alt="4612" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:70%;"> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xilascrowe" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2969291&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607890588" alt="XilasCrowe" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2969291)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xilascrowe" >XilasCrowe</a></span>' art inspired by SCP-4612.</p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:100%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/5079"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/5079/medium.jpg" style="width:70%;" alt="5079" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:70%;"> <p>Dr. Whitney's art inspired by SCP-5079.</p> </div> </div> <br /> <em>See more from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-whitney" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5252186&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607890588" alt="Dr Whitney" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5252186)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-whitney" >Dr Whitney</a></span> here</em>: <strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/dr-whitney-s-art-pile">Dr. Whitney's Art Page</a></strong><br /> <em>Also see this cool Comic they did</em>: <strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/the-idea-of-justice">Justice</a></strong> <hr /> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:100%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/5079A"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/5079A/medium.jpg" style="width:70%;" alt="5079A" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:70%;"> <p>IAmReal's art inspired by SCP-5079.</p> </div> </div> <br /> <em>If you want to see more from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/iamreal" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5886073&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607890588" alt="IAmReal" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5886073)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/iamreal" >IAmReal</a></span>, check out their tumblr page: <a href="https://iamreal44.tumblr.com/">IAmReal's tumblr</a></em> <hr /> <blockquote> <p>Check out forbiddenquest's <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/forbiddenquest">author page</a></p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h4><span><strong>TRANSLATIONS</strong>:</span></h4> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Open</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">So&nbsp;Flattered&nbsp;by&nbsp;These!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><a href="http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/scp-4612">SCP-4612</a> - <em>On the Japanese Branch Wiki</em><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4612">SCP-4612</a> - <em>On the Chinese Branch Wiki</em><br /> <a href="http://lafundacionscp.wikidot.com/scp-4612">SCP-4612</a> - <em>On the Spanish Branch Wiki</em></p> <p><a href="http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/scp-4712">SCP-4712</a> - <em>On the Japanese Branch Wiki</em></p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5079">SCP-5079</a> - <em>On the Chinese Branch Wiki</em></p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5612">SCP-5612</a> - <em>On the Chinese Branch Wiki</em></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h4><span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">INFOGRAPHICS</span></strong>:</span></h4> </div> <br /> I've started to craft infographics that represent a simple lecture into the SCP Foundation in and out of universe. <p>If you'd like to take a look:<br /> <a href="https://imgur.com/a/Kv0wfOZ">Grig's SCP-Wiki 101</a></p> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <h2><span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">List of Articles created</span></strong>:</span></h2> <h3><span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Co-authored by me</span></strong>:</span></h3> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-84104-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. They connect and should be read in order, if you want the maximum experience&#8230; although you could read them separately as well.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-84104-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. This was my first attempt at writing an article, its still my most successful to date.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-84104-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. Technically not really part of the series, but following the antics of Dr. Varga and Agent Douglas after SCP-4612, and the events here become important later.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-84104-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. I have probably never written anything more personal.</div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Ignore&nbsp;this</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Leave&nbsp;me&nbsp;Alone</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>(Wanting to catch up on S&amp;C Plastics, so I put this here for my own reference)</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;For&nbsp;research&nbsp;-&nbsp;Ignore&nbsp;this&nbsp;◄</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Shhhhhhhh</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="licensebox22"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Cite this page as:</p> <p>For more information, see <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-guide">Licensing Guide</a>.<br /> <strong>Licensing Disclosures</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> Bones<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> Me<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Paris Catacombs</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> 5079<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-whitney" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5252186&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607890588" alt="Dr Whitney" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5252186)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-whitney" >Dr Whitney</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Fan-art of 5079</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> 50791<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/iamreal" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5886073&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607890588" alt="IAmReal" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5886073)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/iamreal" >IAmReal</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Fan-art of 5079</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> solid<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forbiddenquest" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394686&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607890588" alt="forbiddenquest" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394686)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forbiddenquest" >forbiddenquest</a></span><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Fan-art of ME</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> projecthecatoncheires<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> ME<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Derivative of two pics (hand and Foundation Emblem), see below:</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename</strong>: Hand<br /> <strong>Author</strong>: jakub<br /> <strong>License</