				<title>Fragmented Memory 1289</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/fragmented-memory-1289</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;color: white; font-size: 8pt; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#6c316c; background:linear-gradient(#562756, #6c316c); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hmm. This place looks cozy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 20px;&quot; width=&quot;120px&quot; alt=&quot;Cubie.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;clear: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hey! Who are you? This is a restricted server.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alex1.png&quot; style=&quot;margin-right: 20px;&quot; width=&quot;75px&quot; alt=&quot;alex1.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;clear: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;color: white; font-size: 8pt; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#6c316c; background:linear-gradient(#562756, #6c316c); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oh, a new friend! Hi! I&#039;m &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4876&quot;&gt;Cubie&lt;/a&gt;. I am new around these parts. What&#039;s your name?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 20px;&quot; width=&quot;120px&quot; alt=&quot;Cubie.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;clear: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;&quot;&gt;
