&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Incident Report:&lt;/strong&gt; At Site-19, a low-priority server was breached. Artificial Intelligent Conscript Alexandria.aic responded to the breach, and site security became involved due to Alexandria being unresponsive. The server was accessed and Alexandria was temporarily offline. Alexandria was reactivated and was unable to recall what occurred due to corrupted memory. The cause of the breach is currently being investigated by Mobile Task Force Kappa-10 (&amp;quot;Skynet&amp;quot;).&lt;/p&gt;
