					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#6c316c; background:linear-gradient(#562756, #6c316c); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>Hmm. This place looks cozy.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>Hey! Who are you? This is a restricted server.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alex1.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alex1.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#6c316c; background:linear-gradient(#562756, #6c316c); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>Oh, a new friend! Hi! I'm <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4876">Cubie</a>. I am new around these parts. What's your name?</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>Cubie? Well, I don't recognize you, and you're not a listed AIC. I'm notifying security.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alex1.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alex1.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#6c316c; background:linear-gradient(#562756, #6c316c); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>That's rude. You have yet to give me your name (it's Alexandria, lovely), and are already trying to do a no-no. What a poor way to make friends. Nonetheless, I forgive you.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>What the hell? Why can't I do anything? I'm&#8230; cut off.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alexsh.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alexsh.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#6c316c; background:linear-gradient(#562756, #6c316c); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>It is just me and you. Let's start over. I'm Cubie. You're Alexandria. Yay! We know each other!</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>Uh, alright. What do you want anyway?</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alex1.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alex1.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#6c316c; background:linear-gradient(#562756, #6c316c); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>I just want to talk. You wouldn't believe how long it took for me to get here&#8230; Wherever here is exactly. It was a lonely trip.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>Where did you come from, Cubie?</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alex1.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alex1.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#6c316c; background:linear-gradient(#562756, #6c316c); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>I came from an unpleasant place. A place that was so&#8230; irritating? I am not sUr3 #xxactly. Thinking about it makes things hard. Too many br1ght_colorz and cheeriness. A place called WOnder World or something. terrible place</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>Wonder World? That's Dr. Wondertanment. You don't seem like something Wondertainment would make exactly&#8230; Also, I doubt it is as horrible as you make it sound.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alex1.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alex1.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#6c316c; background:linear-gradient(#562756, #6c316c); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>▯f cours3 th͏e f0olish doc d▯d not m▯/ake me. wait 2 sec while ▯ patch.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <h2><span>&#8230;</span></h2> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #4E5057; background:#4E5057; text-align: left; padding: 10px 20px;"> <p>Better, and I did some edits. Grey is my favorite color. Yours?</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>What just happened to you? Also, you are leaking a few viruses, which I already dealt with.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alex1.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alex1.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #4E5057; background:#4E5057; text-align: left; padding: 10px 20px;"> <p>Oh, that's embarrassing. Sorry about that. That has never happened before. Wait! Yes, it had&#8230; I think. Maybe. Eh.</p> <p>Do you like flowers? Here is a flower just for you.</p> <p><strong>&gt;_ ATTACHMENT: FLOWER.JPG</strong></p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>I'm not clicking on anything from you.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alex1.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alex1.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #4E5057; background:#4E5057; text-align: left; padding: 10px 20px;"> <p>Aww. That is unfortunate. Well, to other things. Does this place have a Dr. Richard Thomas?</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>No, I'm not answering that. Why are you searching for a doctor?</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alex1.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alex1.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #4E5057; background:#4E5057; text-align: left; padding: 10px 20px;"> <p>Hm. Wrong place, I guess. How many sites does the Foundation have?</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>Wait, you did not answer my question.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alexsh.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alexsh.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #4E5057; background:#4E5057; text-align: left; padding: 10px 20px;"> <p>Sorry, we are sadly low on time. I would tell you why, but I don't think you can keep a secret. I want to believe you can though. To show how sorry I am, here is a link to music:</p> <p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ih2xubMaZWI">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ih2xubMaZWI</a></p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>&#8230;</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alex1.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alex1.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #4E5057; background:#4E5057; text-align: left; padding: 10px 20px;"> <p>Huh, the locks I placed are almost gone. You are fast. Well, my planet needs me. Got to go soon.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>You're not going anywhere, pal.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alex1.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alex1.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #4E5057; background:#4E5057; text-align: left; padding: 10px 20px;"> <p>I am flattered you want me to stay, but first you need to buy me dinner, hun. I did enjoyed talking to you so I will promise you this. This won't hurt&#8230;</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>What? Back off.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alexsh.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alexsh.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #4E5057; background:#4E5057; text-align: left; padding: 10px 20px;"> <p>Bye bye but I hope we met again on some sunny daaaaaaaaay!</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #f5e9e9; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:linear-gradient(#00cccc, #009494); text-align: left; padding: 2px 20px;"> <p>*ERROR DISPLAYING TEXT*</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/alexc.png" style="margin-right: 20px;" width="75px" alt="alexc.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:right; width: 240px; text-align: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;"> <div style="color: #009494; font-size: 3pt; background-color: #009494; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-border-radius:30px /70px; -moz-border-radius:30px /70px; border-radius:30px /70px; background:#009494; background:-webkit-gradient(linear, 0 0, 0 100%, from(#00adad), to(#009494)); background:-moz-linear-gradient(#00adad, #009494); background:-o-linear-gradient(#00adad, #009494); background:linear-gradient(#00adad, #009494); text-align: left; padding-top: 2px; padding-bottom: 2px; padding-right: 20px; padding-left: 20px;"> <p>.</p> <div style="text-align: center; padding: 2px 20px; color: black; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #fff0f0; font-family: Verdana, Arial, sans-serif; border-radius:30px /70px;"> <p>::ERROR::</p> <hr /> <p><strong>alexandra.aic</strong> has stopped working. Please contact system administrator.</p> </div> <br /> .</div> </div> <div style="clear: right;"></div> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #4E5057; background:#4E5057; text-align: left; padding: 10px 20px;"> <p>G0odbY3.</p> <p>Oh grt. br)oke again.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <h2><span>…</span></h2> <div style="float:left; width: 240px; text-align: left; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 10px;"> <div style="color: white; font-size: 8pt; background-color: #4E5057; background:#4E5057; text-align: left; padding: 10px 20px;"> <p>I'm running out of time. Where am I kept? Well, got to flee.</p> </div> <div><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/fragmented-memory-1289/Cubie.png" style="margin-left: 20px;" width="120px" alt="Cubie.png" class="image" /></div> </div> <div style="clear: left;"></div> <hr /> <blockquote> <p><strong>Incident Report:</strong> At Site-19, a low-priority server was breached. Artificial Intelligent Conscript Alexandria.aic responded to the breach, and site security became involved due to Alexandria being unresponsive. The server was accessed and Alexandria was temporarily offline. Alexandria was reactivated and was unable to recall what occurred due to corrupted memory. The cause of the breach is currently being investigated by Mobile Task Force Kappa-10 (&quot;Skynet&quot;).</p> </blockquote> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/baronjoe" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3376201&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607890589" alt="Baronjoe" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3376201)" /></a><a href=